1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,050
This is MatchProof from Team Hyunjae.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:07,350
Marriage matchmaking agencies need not retain detailed
document copies.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:11,900
Applicants consent to proving the required eligibility
conditions.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:17,200
This demo uses synthetic data on Midnight Local
Devnet.

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:24,350
The issuer checks the evidence and gives the applicant
a credential.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,600
The agency creates a review request.

7
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:32,850
The applicant reviews the conditions to disclose, then
proves them.

8
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,900
Midnight verifies the proof.

9
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:40,250
The agency reads the approval without receiving the
original documents.

10
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:44,780
This is an eligible credential issued in advance.

11
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:47,380
It is bound to the applicant's key.

12
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:50,980
The issuance transaction was confirmed before
recording.

13
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:58,430
The applicant imports the issuer's credential into an
encrypted vault.

14
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:03,080
The synthetic income is KRW 65 million for 2025.

15
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:06,730
The applicant was not married on the evidence check
date.

16
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:10,880
This credential file is not sent to the agency.

17
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:16,600
The agency creates a new request, DEMO-003.

18
00:01:16,850 --> 00:01:21,200
The policy requires 2025 income of at least KRW 50
million,

19
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:24,800
and not being married on the evidence check date.

20
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:30,550
Evidence must stay within seven days of its check date
through the deadline.

21
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:33,900
The request is valid for ten minutes.

22
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:38,250
The applicant imports the confirmed request file.

23
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:46,900
The applicant reviews the recipient, conditions,
disclosure and deadline.

24
00:01:47,150 --> 00:01:51,900
Original documents and exact income are not disclosed.

25
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:55,200
Even with both the credential and request imported,

26
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:59,700
the proof button remains disabled until the applicant
consents.

27
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:03,250
The applicant reviews the details and gives consent.

28
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:06,600
Now the applicant proves the conditions.

29
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:09,500
The Compact circuit checks the issued credential,

30
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:14,050
applicant key ownership and the request conditions.

31
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:18,100
The proof server processes private inputs.

32
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:21,350
The development wallet signs automatically.

33
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:25,750
Success is shown only after chain confirmation.

34
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:30,500
In this recording, from the button click to
confirmation:

35
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:33,900
about 24.3 seconds.

36
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:43,050
The same request, DEMO-003, now shows Conditions met
in the agency view.

37
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:52,000
Its public request ID starts with f2f55ca6.

38
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:57,600
The agency receives neither exact income nor the
applicant's credential.

39
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:00,950
It can still verify the approval result.

40
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:07,910
A separate browser has no connected wallet or
applicant vault.

41
00:03:08,110 --> 00:03:13,260
It uses the deployment address to read the same public
request's approval.

42
00:03:14,010 --> 00:03:17,260
The indexer is an off-chain query server.

43
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:21,010
The current app relies on its response.

44
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:28,780
This is DEMO-002 with a credential showing KRW 30
million income.

45
00:03:29,030 --> 00:03:34,580
The pre-submission check rejects it for insufficient
income.

46
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:39,530
Only the applicant sees the detailed failure reason.

47
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:44,520
In the agency view, DEMO-002 remains unapproved.

48
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:47,320
The approval count does not increase.

49
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:50,870
The agency does not see the insufficient-income
reason.

50
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:56,080
Ten-minute expiry limits the request's use.

51
00:03:56,330 --> 00:03:59,880
Expiry does not delete historical chain records.

52
00:04:00,330 --> 00:04:04,580
The current contract has no deletion or immediate
revocation function.

53
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:11,330
We do not claim that expiry alone satisfies personal-
data erasure obligations.

54
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:18,280
On the development chain, we verified issuance,
requests and proof confirmation,

55
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:21,980
plus separate public reads and failure handling.

56
00:04:22,330 --> 00:04:26,680
A fresh clone of the public repository passed
installation, compilation

57
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:30,830
and 38 tests.

58
00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:34,680
The truth of the evidence relies on the issuer.

59
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:37,980
There is no integration with actual government
agencies.

60
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:44,830
MatchProof reduces the detailed information collected
and retained by agencies.

61
00:04:45,230 --> 00:04:51,230
Source code and run instructions: github.com/team-
hyunjae/MatchProof
